{"packageRef":{"id":"content.c.p05","version":"1.0.0"},"subject":{"id":"exercise.c.array-sum","version":"1.1.0","title":"数组求和","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"lessonRef":{"id":"lesson.c.array-sum","version":"1.1.0"},"learningRevision":1,"acceptedPriorVersions":["1.0.1"],"knowledgeRefs":[{"id":"knowledge.c.arrays","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"knowledge.c.loops","version":"1.0.0"}],"programRef":{"id":"program.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0"},"judgeRef":{"id":"judge.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0"},"prompt":"输入values长度0到30、元素-999到999，保留输入绑定且不改变逻辑长度n。循环遍历[0,n)的元素，真实累加并输出总和及换行。[]的和为0，不能读取占位元素；[3,-1,2]为4，[7]为7，[0,0]为0，30个999为29970，30个-999为-29970。非空必须实际遍历并将读取贡献到输出，不接受装饰循环加固定答案。所有测试正常结束且返回0。思路：sum从0开始，逐项加，循环结束后输出。","tests":[{"caseKey":"normal","input":{"values":[3,-1,2]},"expectedStdout":"4\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"empty","input":{"values":[]},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"one","input":{"values":[7]},"expectedStdout":"7\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"zeros","input":{"values":[0,0]},"expectedStdout":"0\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"upper-maximum","input":{"values":[999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999,999]},"expectedStdout":"29970\n","expectedExitCode":0},{"caseKey":"lower-maximum","input":{"values":[-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999,-999]},"expectedStdout":"-29970\n","expectedExitCode":0}],"rewardRef":{"id":"reward.exercise.first-pass","version":"1.0.0"}},"program":{"id":"program.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0","title":"数组求和参考","languageRef":{"id":"lang.c","version":"1.0.0"},"subsetRef":{"id":"subset.c.p0","version":"1.0.0"},"inputRef":{"id":"input.c.int-sequence","version":"1.0.0"},"exampleInput":{"values":[3,-1,2]},"sourceExample":"#include <stdio.h>\nint main(void) {\n    int n = 3;\n    int values[3] = {3, -1, 2};\n    int sum = 0;\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i = i + 1) {\n        sum = sum + values[i];\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", sum);\n    return 0;\n}\n","bindings":[{"bindingKey":"param.n","inputKey":"values","targetName":"n","targetKind":"logical-length","from":"length-of"},{"bindingKey":"param.values","inputKey":"values","targetName":"values","targetKind":"array","from":"field","emptyStorage":"one-zero-placeholder"}],"blockRefs":[{"id":"block.c.main","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.integer","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-int","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.assign-variable","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.arithmetic","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.comparison","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.for","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.declare-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.read-array","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.printf","version":"1.0.0"},{"id":"block.c.return","version":"1.0.0"}],"reference":{"document":"../架构决策/01.3-正反样例清单.md","locator":"REF-06"}},"inputSpec":{"id":"input.c.int-sequence","version":"1.0.0","title":"逻辑整数序列","fields":[{"key":"values","kind":"sequence","min":-999,"max":999,"minItems":0,"maxItems":30}],"relations":[{"kind":"length-of","field":"values","target":"n"}]},"judgeProfile":{"id":"judge.c.array-sum","version":"1.0.0","title":"逻辑遍历累加检查","rule":"logical-array-accumulation","targetDescription":"真实循环读取[0,n)累加到输出，空序列不读占位。"}}